<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Seller Registration</title>
  <!-- Google Fonts -->
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <!-- Bootstrap CSS -->
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary-color: #198754;
      --primary-hover: #146c43;
      --bg-color: #f3f4f6;
      --card-bg: #ffffff;
      --text-main: #1f2937;
      --text-muted: #6b7280;
      --input-border: #d1d5db;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-color);
      background-image: radial-gradient(#198754 0.5px, transparent 0.5px), radial-gradient(#198754 0.5px, var(--bg-color) 0.5px);
      background-size: 20px 20px;
      background-position: 0 0, 10px 10px;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px;
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .container {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      padding: 40px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 550px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
      position: relative;
    }

    h1 {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
      color: var(--primary-color);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    /* Progress Indicator Styling */
    .step-indicator {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      position: relative;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      max-width: 300px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    .step-indicator::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 2px;
      background: #e5e7eb;
      z-index: 1;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
    }

    .step-indicator span {
      width: 35px;
      height: 35px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      z-index: 2;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .step-indicator span.active {
      border-color: var(--primary-color);
      background: var(--primary-color);
      color: white;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(25, 135, 84, 0.2);
    }

    /* Form Elements */
    label {
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--text-main);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      display: block;
    }

    input[type="text"],
    input[type="email"],
    input[type="password"],
    select,
    input[type="file"] {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--input-border);
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      background-color: #fff;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }

    input:focus, select:focus {
      border-color: var(--primary-color);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(25, 135, 84, 0.15);
      outline: none;
    }

    .row-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 15px;
    }

    /* Buttons */
    .step-buttons {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-top: 20px;
      gap: 15px;
    }

    button {
      padding: 10px 24px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      flex: 1;
    }

    button[onclick^="next"], button[type="submit"] {
      background-color: var(--primary-color);
      color: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--primary-color);
    }

    button[onclick^="next"]:hover, button[type="submit"]:hover {
      background-color: var(--primary-hover);
      border-color: var(--primary-hover);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    button[onclick^="prev"] {
      background-color: white;
      color: var(--text-main);
      border: 1px solid var(--input-border);
    }

    button[onclick^="prev"]:hover {
      background-color: #f9fafb;
      border-color: #9ca3af;
    }

    .step {
      display: none;
      animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease-in-out;
    }
    
    .step.active {
      display: block;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    a {
      color: var(--primary-color);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .form-check-label {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--text-main);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .form-check-input:checked {
      background-color: var(--primary-color);
      border-color: var(--primary-color);
    }

    .login-link {
      margin-top: 25px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    
    /* Modal Specific Styles */
    .modal-header {
        background-color: var(--primary-color);
        color: white;
    }
    .modal-title {
        font-weight: 600;
    }
    .btn-close {
        filter: invert(1) grayscale(100%) brightness(200%);
    }
    .modal-body h6 {
        color: var(--primary-color);
        margin-top: 15px;
        font-weight: 700;
    }
    .modal-body p {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: #555;
    }
    
    /* Warning text inside modal */
    .warning-text {
        color: #dc3545; /* Bootstrap Danger Color */
        background: rgba(220, 53, 69, 0.1);
        padding: 10px;
        border-left: 4px solid #dc3545;
        font-weight: 600;
        border-radius: 4px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Seller Registration</h1>

    <div class="step-indicator">
      <span id="dot1" class="active">1</span>
      <span id="dot2">2</span>
      <span id="dot3">3</span>
    </div>

    <form id="sellerForm" action="/seller/auth/register" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data">

      <!-- Step 1: Account Info -->
      <div class="step active" id="step1">
        <label>Full Name</label>
        <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Enter Name" required />

        <label>Email Address</label>
        <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Enter Email" required />

        <label>Password</label>
        <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="••••••••" required />

        <div class="step-buttons">
            <div style="flex:1"></div> 
            <button type="button" onclick="nextStep(1)">Next Step &rarr;</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2: Business Details -->
      <div class="step" id="step2">
        <label>Business Name</label>
        <input type="text" name="businessName" placeholder="Enter Business Name" required />

        <div class="row-grid">
            <div>
                <label>Business Type</label>
                <select name="businessType" required>
                  <option value="" disabled selected>Select Type</option>
                  <option value="Individual">Individual</option>
                  <option value="Company">Company</option>
                </select>
            </div>
            <div>
                <label>PAN Number</label>
                <input type="text" name="panNumber" placeholder="Enter PAN Number" required />
            </div>
        </div>

        <label>GST Number <span style="color:#999; font-weight:normal;"> </span></label>
        <input type="text" name="gstNumber" placeholder="Enter GST Number" />

        <div class="row-grid">
            <div>
                <label>Bank Account Number</label>
                <input type="text" name="bankAccountNo" required />
            </div>
            <div>
                <label>IFSC Code</label>
                <input type="text" name="ifscCode" required />
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="step-buttons">
          <button type="button" onclick="prevStep(2)">&larr; Back</button>
          <button type="button" onclick="nextStep(2)">Next Step &rarr;</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3: Address & Docs -->
      <div class="step" id="step3">
        <label>Street Address</label>
        <input type="text" name="address" placeholder="Enter Address" required />

        <div class="row-grid">
            <input type="text" name="city" placeholder="City" required />
            <input type="text" name="state" placeholder="State" required />
        </div>
        <input type="text" name="pincode" placeholder="Pincode / Zip" style="width: 50%;" required />

        <hr style="border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin: 20px 0;">
        <h6 style="color:var(--text-main); margin-bottom:15px;">Upload Documents</h6>

        <div class="mb-3">
            <label>PAN Card Document</label>
            <input type="file" class="form-control" name="panDoc" accept=".jpg,.png,.pdf" required />
        </div>

        <div class="mb-3">
            <label>GST Document</label>
            <input type="file" class="form-control" name="gstDoc" accept=".jpg,.png,.pdf" />
        </div>

        <div class="mb-3">
            <label>Cancelled Cheque / Bank Proof</label>
            <input type="file" class="form-control" name="bankDoc" accept=".jpg,.png,.pdf" required />
        </div>

        <!-- Declarations -->
        <div class="card p-3 bg-light border-0 mb-3">
          <!-- Terms Checkbox -->
          <div class="form-check mb-2">
            <input 
              class="form-check-input" 
              type="checkbox" 
              id="termsAccepted" 
              name="termsAccepted" 
              required
            >
            <label class="form-check-label" for="termsAccepted">
              I agree to the <a href="#" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#termsModal">Terms & Conditions</a>
            </label>
          </div>

          <!-- Made in India Checkbox with NEW MODAL LINK -->
          <div class="form-check">
            <input 
              class="form-check-input" 
              type="checkbox" 
              id="indianGoods" 
              name="indianGoods" 
              required
            >
            <label class="form-check-label" for="indianGoods">
              I confirm >50% of goods are Made in India 
              <a href="#" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#madeInIndiaModal" style="font-size: 0.85rem; margin-left: 5px;">(Read Policy)</a>
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="step-buttons">
          <button type="button" onclick="prevStep(3)">&larr; Back</button>
          <button type="submit">Complete Registration</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </form>

    <p class="text-center login-link">
      Already have a seller account? <a href="/seller/auth/login">Login here</a>
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- 1. TERMS AND CONDITIONS MODAL -->
  <div class="modal fade" id="termsModal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-scrollable modal-lg">
      <div class="modal-content">
        <div class="modal-header">
          <h5 class="modal-title">Terms & Conditions</h5>
          <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
        </div>
        <div class="modal-body" style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;">
    <h6 class="fw-bold text-success">1. Free Shipping Policy</h6>
    <p>The platform provides <b>Free Shipping</b> to all customers. As a seller, you are solely responsible for managing and financing the delivery of your products. Please ensure your <b>Product Listing Price includes shipping costs</b>, as the platform will not pay any additional delivery fees.</p>

    <h6 class="fw-bold text-success">2. Fees & Commissions</h6>
    <p>A flat <b>10% service commission</b> will be deducted from the effective selling price (final price paid by the customer). The remaining 90% share will be credited to your pending balance upon successful order placement.</p>

    <h6 class="fw-bold text-success">3. Returns & Reverse Logistics</h6>
    <p>Customers are entitled to a <b>7-day return window</b> starting from the date of delivery. In the case of a return request, the seller is responsible for arranging the pickup and covering the return shipping costs. Upon a successful refund, the 90% seller share will be deducted from your pending balance.</p>

    <h6 class="fw-bold text-success">4. Dispatch SLA (Timeline)</h6>
    <p>Sellers must dispatch orders within <b>48 hours</b> of receiving them. You must provide a valid Courier Tracking ID and Receipt or use the designated Local Delivery Boy (OTP) method. Orders not dispatched within 4 days may be subject to automatic cancellation and penalties.</p>

    <h6 class="fw-bold text-success">5. Payout Cycle</h6>
    <p>Funds will be released from your "Pending Balance" to your "Withdrawable Wallet" <b>15 days after successful delivery verification</b>. You may request a payout to your bank account once your wallet balance exceeds ₹100.</p>

    <h6 class="fw-bold text-success">6. Product Authenticity & Quality</h6>
    <p>Only genuine, new, and high-quality products are permitted. Selling counterfeit, expired, or prohibited items will result in an immediate permanent ban and the freezing of all pending funds.</p>

    <h6 class="fw-bold text-success">7. Non-Circumvention Policy</h6>
    <p>Sellers are strictly prohibited from including personal contact numbers, website links, or marketing materials inside the parcel to encourage off-platform transactions. Any attempt to bypass the platform will lead to account termination.</p>
</div>
        <div class="modal-footer">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 2. MADE IN INDIA POLICY MODAL (NEW) -->
  <div class="modal fade" id="madeInIndiaModal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-scrollable">
      <div class="modal-content">
        <div class="modal-header" style="background-color: #d63384; color: white;">
          <h5 class="modal-title">Origin of Goods Policy</h5>
          <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
        </div>
        <div class="modal-body">
            
            <p class="warning-text">
              ⚠️ CRITICAL WARNING: If your goods are found to contain less than 60% Indian content, your registration will be IMMEDIATELY CANCELLED.
            </p>

            <h6>1. The 60% Threshold</h6>
            <p>While the general checkbox requires >60%, our platform enforces a strict <strong>60% Made in India</strong> rule for quality assurance. If your products fall below this 60% threshold during any inspection, your account will be suspended.</p>

            <h6>2. Random Audits</h6>
            <p>We reserve the right to conduct random physical or digital audits. You may be asked to provide raw material invoices or manufacturing proof within 48 hours.</p>

            <h6>3. Non-Compliance Penalties</h6>
            <p>If you fail to prove origin or if goods are imported and relabeled:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Your account will be permanently banned.</li>
              <li>Any pending payouts will be frozen for 90 days.</li>
              <li>You will be blacklisted from future registrations.</li>
            </ul>

            <h6>4. Self-Certification</h6>
            <p>By checking the box, you are self-certifying the origin. False claims are treated as fraud under platform rules.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="modal-footer">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">I Understand</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Bootstrap Bundle JS -->
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>

  <script>
    function nextStep(current) {
      document.getElementById(`step${current}`).classList.remove('active');
      document.getElementById(`step${current+1}`).classList.add('active');
      updateDots(current + 1);
    }
    function prevStep(current) {
       document.getElementById(`step${current}`).classList.remove('active');
      document.getElementById(`step${current-1}`).classList.add('active');
      updateDots(current - 1);
    }
    function updateDots(step) {
      for (let i = 1; i <= 3; i++) {
        document.getElementById(`dot${i}`).classList.remove('active');
      }
      document.getElementById(`dot${step}`).classList.add('active');
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>